OL,4,CCOP31 climate talks end with no deal   
OL,5,Cafter fossil fuels row derails hopes   
OL,6,Cof agreement                           
OL,7,GThe COP31 climate summit in Turkey has 
OL,8,Gformally come to an end after          
OL,9,Gcountries failed to agree a deal -.    
OL,11,FThe EU and some other countries        
OL,12,Frejected a fourth draft agreement over 
OL,13,Fits failure to mention a need to phase 
OL,14,Fout fossil fuels, the largest driver   
OL,15,Fof global climate change.              
OL,17,FAn EU representative accuses some oil  
OL,18,Fstates of hijacking talks, as Russia   
OL,19,Fdefends opposing the inclusion of such 
OL,20,Fa commitment and levels direct         
OL,21,Fcriticism at the EU in its speech.     
OL,22,                                   G1/3 
