OL,4,CCOP31 climate talks end with no deal   
OL,5,Cafter fossil fuels row derails hopes   
OL,6,Cof agreement                           
OL,7,FThe draft acknowledges the goal set by 
OL,8,Fthe 2015 Paris Agreement of keeping    
OL,9,Fthe rise in global temperatures below  
OL,10,F1.5C is going to be missed - as        
OL,11,Fwarming goes beyond this the effects   
OL,12,Fof climate change will ramp up         
OL,13,Fsignificantly.                         
OL,22,                                   G3/3 
